tps://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T18:00:30Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T18:00:30Z","body":"That would be expensive as it would check *every* call to it even if it doesn't have it","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797664158/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797739851","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105284#issuecomment-2797739851","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105284","id":2797739851,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mwh9L","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T18:32:03Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T18:32:03Z","body":"Thanks for opening a pull request :slightly_smiling_face: \r\n\r\nFeature pull requests should be associated to a *feature proposal* to justify the need for implementing the feature in Godot core. Please open a proposal on the [Godot proposals](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals) repository (and link to this pull request in the proposal's body).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797739851/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842355762","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105284#issuecomment-2842355762","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105284","id":2842355762,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6paugy","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-30T15:20:36Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T15:20:49Z","body":"I sympathise, as a non-native English speaker, but the reasoning for this PR (\"_for those that spell it differently or don't remember the \"right\" way to spell it.\"_) is not substantial. And that's aside from the aforementioned reasons. \r\nGodot's API very strictly adheres to US English, and also has very, very few aliases (such as constants meaning the same thing). Adding more code to handle typos is a waste of memory. Granted, this PR is relatively small. However, by the same aforementioned reasoning, nothing would stop other aliases from being merged, all of which somewhat bloat the already quite vast selection of Color constants.\r\n\r\nWhen browsing the class reference, the confusion could be mitigated by keywords, without any runtime cost. For example:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8edf97e3425ebb028de2635d6543fc89983ef8c5/doc/classes/Color.xml#L321\r\nAutocompletion generally helps already, too.\r\n\r\nHowever, to play devil's advocate, there's a counterargument to be had. **AQUA** and **CYAN** are quite literally the same colour. To me this sounds like a legacy oversight, but it's still worth noting.\r\n\r\nEither way, open a proposal for further discussion.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842355762/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842371681","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105284#issuecomment-2842371681","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105284","id":2842371681,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6payZh","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-30T15:25:45Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T15:25:45Z","body":"I agree with Mickeon, and in general the Godot API is standardized on US English. This is not to discount the validity of other English variants, but we need to stick to one to have a common language.\r\n\r\nThe `Color` class itself uses US spelling, and we're not going to add a duplicate `Colour` class to the engine for Commonwealth countries.\r\n\r\nWhat can be done however is to add the \"grey\" spelling as keywords to the constant in the docs, so that users searching for it will find it. It won't be used in auto-completion however, but just like `Color.GRIS` isn't available either when using Godot in French.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842371681/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]